{
  "name": "Time Travel",
  "type": "consumable",
  "img": "icons/consumables/potions/bottle-conical-corked-yellow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You travel back in time for exaclty 30 minutes.</p><ol><li><p>you do not change! The world around you does.</p></li><li><p>you coexists with your past.</p></li><li><p>rules of timetravel: You can not change anything effecting your personal perspective of history !</p></li></ol><p>If you violate the rules of timetravel your time travel ends immidiatly and you return to your timeline where everything has happend as before.</p><p>( In reality you just open up a new parallel timeline, sadly your mind is bonded to this one. )</p><p></p><p>When your time is up or after your violate the rules of timetravel, your existence vanishes while simultaniously your past is strucked down at 0 hitpoints. When you manage to survive or revive your mind is the mind of your traveled you.</p><p></p><section id=\"secret-9Vw4JUl0dZ2IJrjX\" class=\"secret\"><p>You do not change! the world around you does: <br />You start your existence in the past at the exact same spot your are currently in with exact the same stats and equipment you currently posses.<br /><br />rules of timetravel: <br />Will lead to you doing exactly the same as before! Your past is not aware of your future help  ! But wait why should you then drink this potion. !Be creative ! The changes you did could change the future thereafter. e.g. You have been chased down by an angry mop and ended up here in front of a locked door. If only someone would have left a key below that doormat. </p></section><p></p>",
